<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN SHIPPING - CONSTANTA OIL TERMINAL.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN SHIPPING - CONSTANTA OIL TERMINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were loading, discharging in the Black Sea port of Constanta on Wednesday, port authorities said.</p>
<p>	SHIP		  COMMODITY	 OPERATION	TONNES</p>
<p> - Ayberk Kalk	    diesel oil	   ldg	    28,000</p>
<p> - Bucsani		  crude		  dsg	    25,000</p>
<p> - Sibonancy		petrol		 ldg	    65,000</p>
